#### 0. System Constraints (Hard Enforcement)
*   **Scoring Anchor:** Baseline (Standard HEMT + λ/4 Resonator) = 60 points. Target = 90 points (SNR > 12 in 200 ns, QND Fidelity > 99.9%).
